list.item:
Language - categorized as follows: - 

Old Church Slavonic (OCS): 9th–11th centuries; 

Church Slavonic (CS): 12th–17th centuries (including regional redactions: Bulgarian, East Slavic, Serbian); 

New Church Slavonic (NCS): 18th century; 

Ruthenian / Ruska mova (Rut): 15th–18th centuries;
